    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// Prepare Lead\n// Normalizes form input (form labels OR snake_case keys from pinned test data)\n// and calculates the deterministic part of the score: budget, timeline, company size.\nconst i = $json;\n\nconst pick = (...keys) => {\n  for (const k of keys) {\n    const v = i[k];\n    if (v !== undefined && v !== null && String(v).trim() !== '') return String(v).trim();\n  }\n  return '';\n};\n\n// Treat en dash / em dash and hyphen the same, so \"2–10\" and \"2-10\" both match\nconst norm = (s) => s.replace(/[–—]/g, '-');\n\nconst lead = {\n  name: pick('name', 'Full name'),\n  email: pick('email', 'Work email').toLowerCase(),\n  company: pick('company', 'Company'),\n  company_size: pick('company_size', 'Company size'),\n  budget: pick('budget', 'Estimated budget'),\n  timeline: pick('timeline', 'When do you want to start?'),\n  need: pick('need', 'What do you need help with?'),\n};\n\nconst BUDGET = { '$25,000+': 35, '$10,000-$25,000': 25, '$5,000-$10,000': 15, 'Not sure yet': 10, 'Under $5,000': 5 };\nconst TIMELINE = { 'Within 1 month': 25, '1-3 months': 20, '3-6 months': 10, 'Just exploring': 3 };\nconst SIZE = { 'Just me': 3, '2-10': 8, '11-50': 15, '51-200': 15, '201+': 10 };\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ...lead,\n    score_budget: BUDGET[norm(lead.budget)] ?? 0,\n    score_timeline: TIMELINE[norm(lead.timeline)] ?? 0,\n    score_size: SIZE[norm(lead.company_size)] ?? 0,\n    test_mode: i.test_mode === true,\n    test_inbox: i.test_inbox || '',\n    submitted_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n    raw_input: JSON.stringify(lead),\n  },\n};\n"
      },
      "id": "b82de433-1bfa-4a0a-8fcc-bc09f7e9ddaf",
      "name": "Prepare Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -480,
        64
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a lead qualification assistant for Northwind Digital, a software agency that builds custom web applications, mobile apps, internal business tools, and integrations between business systems.\n\nAssess ONLY the lead's need and intent. Budget, timeline and company size are scored separately by another step, so do not score them.\n\nLead:\n- Name: {{ $json.name }}\n- Company: {{ $json.company }}\n- Company size: {{ $json.company_size }}\n- Budget: {{ $json.budget }}\n- Timeline: {{ $json.timeline }}\n- Need: {{ $json.need }}\n\nRules:\n1. need_fit (must be exactly 0, 12 or 25):\n   - 25 = clearly matches Northwind's services (custom web app, mobile app, internal tool, system integration or workflow automation).\n   - 12 = partial or vague match (simple brochure website, early idea without specifics).\n   - 0 = outside Northwind's services (SEO, ads, graphic design, recruitment) or no real need.\n2. is_spam = true for gibberish, test text, promotions, crypto, or an empty or meaningless need.\n3. is_job_seeker = true if the person is looking for a job or internship, or is selling their own services to Northwind.\n4. reason = 1-2 short sentences in English for the sales team, maximum 35 words.\n   - For a real potential client: name the need first, then mention budget and timeline.\n   - If is_job_seeker is true: say what the person is actually asking for (for example an internship). Do not mention budget or timeline.\n   - If is_spam is true: start with \"SPAM:\" and say why. Do not mention budget or timeline.\n   - Write naturally. Do not use phrases like \"As context\" or \"contextual factors\".\n   - Always start with the person's first name, for example \"Sarah needs ...\".",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "ad2abd60-2af9-4085-9196-95faaad31355",
      "name": "AI: Assess Need",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        -288,
        64
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0
        }
      },
      "id": "f82b1060-e8aa-4c5f-97c3-affe633ccc02",
      "name": "Gemini Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -320,
        304
